    ('info@askf.dk', 'ar', '{"sujet": "حين لا تجد أسرةٌ مكانًا في حلقاتكم", "corps": "السلام عليكم ورحمة الله وبركاته،\n\nجزاكم الله خيرًا على ما تبذلونه في تعليم أبناء الجالية كتاب الله، والتعليم الحضوري خير ما يكون إذا تيسّر. غير أنكم تعرفون أسرًا لا تستطيع الحضور: لامتلاء الأماكن، أو لتعارض المواعيد، أو لبعد المسافة.\n\nولهذه الأسر تقدّم أكاديمية الرواية دروسًا مباشرة في القرآن عن بُعد، في فصول صغيرة، مع المعلّم نفسه، ثلاث مرات في الأسبوع. لسنا بديلًا عن حلقاتكم، وإنما نصل إلى من لا تصل إليه.\n\nفإن خطرت ببالكم أسرة في هذه الحال، فيكفي أن ترسلوا إليها هذا الرابط:\nhttps://rewayahacademy.com/ar/familles?ref=arabisk-sprog-og-kultur\n\nقال رسول الله ﷺ: «الدَّالُّ عَلَى الخَيْرِ كَفَاعِلِهِ» (رواه الترمذي).\n\nبارك الله فيكم،\nعبد الله محي الدين صو\nمدير أكاديمية الرواية", "langue_source": "ar", "raison": "وصلكم هذا البريد لأن مؤسستكم تعلّم القرآن وتعلن ذلك.", "campagne": "prospection-v3", "type": "lettre", "segment": "ar", "temoin_sans_image": false, "image": {"src": "https://rewayahacademy.com/fr/assets/courriel-prospection-ar.png", "alt": "لطلابكم الذين لا يستطيعون الحضور. «الدال على الخير كفاعله» رواه الترمذي (2670). أكاديمية الرواية.", "largeur": 600, "hauteur": 315}}'::jsonb, '2026-11-30T10:14:30+00:00'::timestamptz, 'prospection-v3:info@askf.dk'),
    ('education@wimbledonmosque.org', 'en', '{"sujet": "When a child can’t get a place at your madrasah", "corps": "Assalamu alaykum wa rahmatullah,\n\nYour madrasah teaches the Qur’an in person, and that is the best way whenever it is possible. But you will know families who can’t make it: the classes are full, the evening times clash with work or school, or they live too far away.\n\nRewayah Academy is there for them: live online Qur’an classes in small groups, with the same teacher three times a week. We don’t replace your madrasah; we reach the children it can’t.\n\nIf a family comes to mind, simply pass on this link:\nhttps://rewayahacademy.com/en/familles?ref=wimbledon-mosque-madrasa-londres\n\nThe Prophet ﷺ said: “The one who guides to good is like the one who does it.” (at-Tirmidhi)\n\nJazakAllahu khayran,\nAbdoulaye Mouhidine Sow\nDirector, Rewayah Academy", "langue_source": "en", "raison": "You are receiving this message because your organisation teaches the Qur’an and says so publicly.", "campagne": "prospection-v3", "type": "lettre", "segment": "en_uk", "temoin_sans_image": false, "image": {"src": "https://rewayahacademy.com/fr/assets/courriel-prospection-en.png", "alt": "For the students who cannot come. “The one who guides to good is like the one who does it.” Hadith narrated by at-Tirmidhi, no. 2670. Rewayah Academy.", "largeur": 600, "hauteur": 315}}'::jsonb, '2026-11-30T10:15:39+00:00'::timestamptz, 'prospection-v3:education@wimbledonmosque.org'),
    ('isoc@soas.ac.uk', 'en', '{"sujet": "For the families who can’t make it to your madrasah", "corps": "Assalamu alaykum wa rahmatullah,\n\nYour madrasah teaches the Qur’an in person, and that is the best way whenever it is possible. But you will know families who can’t make it: the classes are full, the evening times clash with work or school, or they live too far away.\n\nRewayah Academy is there for them: live online Qur’an classes in small groups, with the same teacher three times a week. We don’t replace your madrasah; we reach the children it can’t.\n\nIf a family comes to mind, simply pass on this link:\nhttps://rewayahacademy.com/en/familles?ref=soas-islamic-society-londres\n\nThe Prophet ﷺ said: “The one who guides to good is like the one who does it.” (at-Tirmidhi)\n\nJazakAllahu khayran,\nAbdoulaye Mouhidine Sow\nDirector, Rewayah Academy", "langue_source": "en", "raison": "You are receiving this message because your organisation teaches the Qur’an and says so publicly.", "campagne": "prospection-v3", "type": "lettre", "segment": "en_uk", "temoin_sans_image": false, "image": {"src": "https://rewayahacademy.com/fr/assets/courriel-prospection-en.png", "alt": "For the students who cannot come. “The one who guides to good is like the one who does it.” Hadith narrated by at-Tirmidhi, no. 2670. Rewayah Academy.", "largeur": 600, "hauteur": 315}}'::jsonb, '2026-11-30T10:16:15+00:00'::timestamptz, 'prospection-v3:isoc@soas.ac.uk'),
