    ('info@madinahcollege.uk', 'en', '{"sujet": "In one sentence", "corps": "Assalamu alaykum,\n\nI wrote to you a few days ago; in one sentence: for the families in your community who can’t attend your classes in person, Rewayah Academy offers live online Qur’an classes as a complement. The link to pass on:\nhttps://rewayahacademy.com/en/familles?ref=madinah-college-london-londres\n\nJazakAllahu khayran,\nAbdoulaye Mouhidine Sow\nDirector, Rewayah Academy", "langue_source": "en", "raison": "You are receiving this message because your organisation teaches the Qur’an and says so publicly.", "campagne": "prospection-v3", "type": "relance", "segment": "en_uk", "temoin_sans_image": true}'::jsonb, '2026-11-30T15:53:50+00:00'::timestamptz, 'prospection-v3:info@madinahcollege.uk'),
    ('convertconnect@masjidtoronto.com', 'en', '{"sujet": "When a family can’t join your weekend school", "corps": "Assalamu alaykum,\n\nYour center gives children something precious: learning the Qur’an together, in person. Still, some families can’t take part: the program is full, the schedule doesn’t work for them, or the drive is simply too long.\n\nThat’s where Rewayah Academy can help: live online Qur’an classes in small groups, with one dedicated teacher, three sessions a week. We complement what you do on site, for the families who can’t be there.\n\nIf a family comes to mind, just share this link with them:\nhttps://rewayahacademy.com/en/familles?ref=mac-masjid-toronto-new\n\nThe Prophet ﷺ said: “The one who guides to good is like the one who does it.” (at-Tirmidhi)\n\nJazakAllahu khayran,\nAbdoulaye Mouhidine Sow\nDirector, Rewayah Academy", "langue_source": "en", "raison": "You are receiving this message because your organisation teaches the Qur’an and says so publicly.", "campagne": "prospection-v3", "type": "lettre", "segment": "en_na", "temoin_sans_image": false, "image": {"src": "https://rewayahacademy.com/fr/assets/courriel-prospection-en.png", "alt": "For the students who cannot come. “The one who guides to good is like the one who does it.” Hadith narrated by at-Tirmidhi, no. 2670. Rewayah Academy.", "largeur": 600, "hauteur": 315}}'::jsonb, '2026-11-30T19:03:00+00:00'::timestamptz, 'prospection-v3:convertconnect@masjidtoronto.com'),
    ('info@mac-quebec.org', 'fr', '{"sujet": "Quand une famille ne peut pas venir à vos cours de fin de semaine", "corps": "Assalamu alaykum wa rahmatullah,\n\nVos cours de Coran de fin de semaine sont précieux. Mais certaines familles ne peuvent pas y venir : groupes complets, horaire qui ne convient pas, ou route trop longue l’hiver.\n\nPour elles, Rewayah Academy offre un complément en ligne : des cours de Coran en direct, en petite classe, avec le même enseignant trois fois par semaine. Nous ne remplaçons pas vos cours : nous rejoignons ceux qu’ils ne peuvent pas rejoindre.\n\nUne famille vous vient à l’esprit ? Transmettez-lui ce lien :\nhttps://rewayahacademy.com/fr/familles?ref=mac-centre-communautaire-de\n\nLe Prophète ﷺ a dit : « Celui qui indique le bien est comme celui qui le fait. » (at-Tirmidhî)\n\nBarakAllahu fikum,\nAbdoulaye Mouhidine Sow\nDirecteur, Rewayah Academy", "langue_source": "fr", "raison": "Vous recevez ce message parce que votre organisation enseigne le Coran et l’annonce publiquement.", "campagne": "prospection-v3", "type": "lettre", "segment": "fr_qc", "temoin_sans_image": false, "image": {"src": "https://rewayahacademy.com/fr/assets/courriel-prospection-fr.png", "alt": "Pour vos élèves qui ne peuvent pas venir. « Celui qui indique le bien est comme celui qui le fait. » Hadith rapporté par at-Tirmidhî, n° 2670. Rewayah Academy.", "largeur": 600, "hauteur": 315}}'::jsonb, '2026-11-30T19:03:46+00:00'::timestamptz, 'prospection-v3:info@mac-quebec.org'),
